{"black_box_warning":{"current_value":"No current FDA/DailyMed label identified.","fda_source_urls":["https://open.fda.gov/apis/drug/label/","https://api.fda.gov/drug/label.json"],"proposed_value":"No current FDA/openFDA label identified.","rationale":"Substantive no-current-FDA-label finding is plausible, but boxed-warning verification must cite FDA/openFDA, FDA label, or Drugs@FDA only. DailyMed should not appear in this boxed-warning field.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"incorrect"},"blocking_questions":[],"fact_checks":[{"current_value":"metharbital","field":"generic_name","proposed_value":"metharbital","rationale":"NCBI/PubChem and FDA-linked substance/Orange Book references identify metharbital as the active ingredient.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"verified","supporting_sources":["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/Metharbital","https://www.fda.gov/drugs/drug-approvals-and-databases/orange-book-data-files"]},{"current_value":"","field":"alternate_generic_names","proposed_value":"Endiemal; metharbitone; methobarbitone; metarbital","rationale":"Important aliases are missing. PubChem/MeSH lists endiemal, metharbitone, and methobarbitone, and PubChem depositor synonyms include metarbital. These should be captured to avoid alias-based duplicate rows/search misses.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"missing","supporting_sources":["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/Metharbital"]},{"current_value":"Gemonil","field":"trade_names","proposed_value":"Gemonil","rationale":"Gemonil is supported as the metharbital trade/proprietary name by Orange Book-derived references and NCBI/PubChem synonym data.","requires_user_approval":false,"status":"verified","supporting_sources":["https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/Metharbital","https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/scripts/cder/ob/index.cfm"]},{"current_value":"Gemonil","field":"pubmed_search_aliases","proposed_value":"Gemonil; Endiemal; metharbitone; methobarbitone; metarbital","ratio